  "bodyHash": "h7yCoWAnXQk=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組，用心製作。支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的眾多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">GUI 時鐘是一款極簡風格的客戶端模組，當物品欄中有時鐘時，會在畫面上的 GUI 中顯示時間。它可以顯示遊戲內時間或真實時間，並支援 24 小時制或 AM/PM 制。它還可以在時間下方顯示世界經過的天數。除了以數字顯示時間外，也可以在畫面上顯示時鐘圖示，此功能可在設定中啟用。<br><br>預設情況下，當藥水效果啟用時，時鐘會自動下移。</span><br><br></p><p>您可能也會對 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gui-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI 指南針</a></strong></span>感興趣。</p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum's Client Bundle\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveClockInInventoryForGameTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;啟用時，僅在物品欄中有時鐘時才會顯示遊戲時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveClockInInventoryForRealTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;啟用時，僅在物品欄中有時鐘時才會顯示真實時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>lowerClockWhenPlayerHasEffects</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家有藥水效果時，是否將 GUI 中的時鐘下移以防止重疊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>_24hourformat</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將時鐘設定為 24 小時制。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showOnlyMinecraftClockIcon</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，顯示時鐘物品圖示而非帶數字的時鐘。使用 Quark 時，必須停用「時鐘削弱」功能才能正常運作。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showBothTimes</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">同時顯示遊戲內時間和真實本地時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showRealTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;顯示實際本地時間而非遊戲內時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showRealTimeSeconds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;在時鐘中顯示秒數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showDaysPlayedWorld</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">顯示世界經過的天數。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockPositionIsLeft</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將 GUI 時鐘放置在左側。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockPositionIsCenter</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將 GUI 時鐘放置在中間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockPositionIsRight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;將 GUI 時鐘放置在右側。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockHeightOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 5，最小值 0，最大值 3000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的垂直偏移量（Y 座標）。決定時間在螢幕上應向下多少距離。可調整以防止 GUI 重疊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>clockWidthOffset</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 0，最小值 -3000，最大值 3000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的水平偏移量（X 座標）。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>drawTextShadow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">顯示的文字下方是否繪製陰影。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_R</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 255，最小值 0，最大值 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的 RGB 紅色值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_G</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 255，最小值 0，最大值 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的 RGB 綠色值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RGB_B</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 255，最小值 0，最大值 255</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;時鐘的 RGB 藍色值。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>24 小時制時鐘。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"356\" height=\"52\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>12 小時制時鐘。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"52\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>24 小時制時鐘，旁邊顯示電腦的本地時間。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>天數計數器：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"319\" height=\"160\"><br><br></p><p><strong>啟用設定選項 '<em>showOnlyMinecraftClockIcon</em>' 後：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"736\" height=\"166\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟用設定選項 'lowerClockWhenPlayerHasEffects' 後，當藥水效果啟用時，時鐘將自動下移：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/gui-clock/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"614\" height=\"476\"></strong></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，前提是下載鏈接仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多單獨的模組頁面上管理留言，因此已停用留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請參考&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
